# Summary

The statute's retention rule states "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute." [[cite:obs-b7bfc6fba0498213ad9a46f20e28e20f36c819fe "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]

The statute therefore indicates that the records are kept "for the period named in the schedule of this statute." [[cite:obs-b7bfc6fba0498213ad9a46f20e28e20f36c819fe "for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]
